				<h2 id="layout" class={`mb-8 ${Head}`}>
					What changes after install
				</h2>
				<p class="mb-10 max-w-3xl font-body text-base leading-relaxed text-bone-newsprint">
					Two directories, two owners. Hermes owns the plugin directory and the plugin
					owns everything under the runtime home - the arrow annotations below are the
					whole map of who writes what.
